{
    "background_story": "Jude was a gentle soul with a passion for wildlife conservation. Growing up on a rural farm, he developed a special bond with the creatures that lived in the surrounding fields and forests. One summer, a baby rabbit was orphaned during a storm, and Jude took it upon himself to care for the little creature. He named her Rosie and nursed her back to health, feeding her and keeping her safe until she was old enough to be released back into the wild. Jude's love for rabbits only grew stronger, and he went on to study wildlife biology in college. He eventually founded a sanctuary for rescued rabbits and other small animals, dedicating his life to protecting and preserving these gentle creatures. Jude's kindness and compassion earned him the nickname 'The Rabbit Whisperer' among his friends and community.",
